   - **`packages/ai_agent/src/ui/lvgl_ui_channel.h`** (edited): added
     ```c
     /* 清空聊天屏:删掉全部气泡、重置环形缓冲,并把聊天屏切到前台(空会话页)。… */
     int lvgl_ui_channel_clear_history(void);
